{
  "id": 7908,
  "title": "分析通信重叠",
  "meta_title": "通信与计算重叠分析",
  "meta_description": "衡量分布式训练中反向预取和流重叠的效率。",
  "content": "<p>网络互联通常决定着高性能分布式训练的吞吐量 (throughput)上限。尽管现代GPU具备强大的计算能力，但如果设备将大量周期用于等待数据同步，这种潜力就无法发挥。减少“暴露通信”是全分片数据并行（FSDP）训练中性能优化的首要目标。</p>\n<p>当GPU的计算引擎在等待网络完成诸如 <code>AllGather</code> 或 <code>ReduceScatter</code> 等集体操作时处于空闲状态，就会发生暴露通信。理想情况下，这些网络操作应在后台运行，完全被前一层或后一层的计算所掩盖。实现这一点需要精确编排CUDA流以及细致调整FSDP的预取策略。</p>\n<h3>流重叠的机制</h3>\n<p>PyTorch 使用 CUDA 流管理 NVIDIA GPU 上的并发。流是按顺序执行的操作序列，但不同流中的操作可以并发运行。在标准FSDP配置中，至少有两个核心流处于活动状态：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>计算流：</strong> 处理矩阵乘法 (GEMM)、激活以及其他层计算。</li>\n<li><strong>通信 (NCCL) 流：</strong> 处理分片和反分片参数 (parameter)及梯度所需的集体操作。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>为了实现有效重叠，调度器必须在该操作的依赖项解决后立即在 NCCL 流上分派网络内核，而不阻塞计算流。</p>\n<p>以下图表说明了反向传播 (backpropagation)过程中顺序执行与优化重叠之间的差异。在优化流程中，层 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N-1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span> 的通信与层 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span> 的计算同时发生。</p>\n\n            <div\n              class=\"graphviz-container graphviz-enlargeable\" \n              data-graph-id=\"graph-r14ln5\" \n              data-graph-definition='digraph G {\n    rankdir=TB;\n    node [shape=box, style=filled, fontname=\"Arial\", fontsize=10];\n    splines=false;\n\n    subgraph cluster_serial {\n        label=\"顺序执行（高开销）\";\n        style=dashed;\n        color=\"#adb5bd\";\n\n        s1 [label=\"计算层 N\\n（梯度计算）\", fillcolor=\"#a5d8ff\", color=\"#1c7ed6\"];\n        s2 [label=\"AllGather 层 N-1\\n（网络等待）\", fillcolor=\"#ffc9c9\", color=\"#fa5252\"];\n        s3 [label=\"计算层 N-1\\n（梯度计算）\", fillcolor=\"#a5d8ff\", color=\"#1c7ed6\"];\n        s4 [label=\"AllGather 层 N-2\\n（网络等待）\", fillcolor=\"#ffc9c9\", color=\"#fa5252\"];\n\n        s1 -> s2 -> s3 -> s4;\n    }\n\n    subgraph cluster_overlap {\n        label=\"流水线执行（隐藏延迟）\";\n        style=dashed;\n        color=\"#adb5bd\";\n\n        o1 [label=\"计算层 N\", fillcolor=\"#a5d8ff\", color=\"#1c7ed6\"];\n        o2 [label=\"计算层 N-1\", fillcolor=\"#a5d8ff\", color=\"#1c7ed6\"];\n        o3 [label=\"计算层 N-2\", fillcolor=\"#a5d8ff\", color=\"#1c7ed6\"];\n\n        c1 [label=\"AllGather 层 N-1\", fillcolor=\"#b2f2bb\", color=\"#37b24d\"];\n        c2 [label=\"AllGather 层 N-2\", fillcolor=\"#b2f2bb\", color=\"#37b24d\"];\n\n        o1 -> o2 -> o3;\n        o1 -> c1 [style=dotted, label=\"触发\"];\n        o2 -> c2 [style=dotted, label=\"触发\"];\n\n        {rank=same; o2; c1}\n        {rank=same; o3; c2}\n    }\n}' \n              data-original-width=\"1200px\"\n              style=\"max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto; cursor: pointer; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; min-height: 200px;\"\n              title=\"Click to enlarge\"\n              aria-label=\"Graphviz diagram - click to enlarge\"\n              tabindex=\"0\"\n              role=\"button\"\n              onclick=\"window.enlargeGraphviz(this)\"\n              onkeydown=\"if(event.key==='Enter') window.enlargeGraphviz(this)\"\n            >\n              <div id=\"graph-r14ln5\" style=\"width: 100%; min-height: 200px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;\"></div>\n            </div>\n          \n<blockquote>\n<p>反向传播中顺序执行与流水线执行流程的比较。优化流程允许计算流继续运行而无需等待网络，前提是通信在数据被严格需要之前完成。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h3>在追踪中识别暴露通信</h3>\n<p>在 PyTorch Profiler 中分析追踪时，通常使用“GPU 内核”视图查看时间线。为了识别通信瓶颈，请找到 NCCL 内核（通常标记 (token)为 <code>ncclDevKernel_AllGather_...</code> 或 <code>ncclDevKernel_ReduceScatter_...</code>）。</p>\n<p>您必须验证与这些 NCCL 内核垂直对齐 (alignment)的计算流上正在发生什么。</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>完全重叠：</strong> 您会看到计算流上直接位于 NCCL 内核上方有一个密集的 <code>GEMM</code> 或逐元素内核块。GPU 利用率保持在 100%，因为算术单元在数据通过互联移动时处于繁忙状态。</li>\n<li><strong>暴露通信：</strong> 您会看到计算流上与 NCCL 操作对齐的位置有一个间隙或“气泡”。这表明计算提前完成，GPU 现在因等待网络而停滞。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>这种低效率的程度可以通过这些间隙的持续时间总和来计算。有效步长 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi><mtext>步长</mtext></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{\text{步长}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">步长</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 定义为：</p>\n<p><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi><mtext>步长</mtext></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi><mtext>计算</mtext></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi><mtext>暴露通信</mtext></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{\text{步长}} = T_{\text{计算}} + T_{\text{暴露通信}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">步长</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">计算</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">暴露通信</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi><mtext>暴露通信</mtext></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{\text{暴露通信}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">暴露通信</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是未被计算隐藏的网络时间部分。您的目标是将 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi><mtext>暴露通信</mtext></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{\text{暴露通信}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">暴露通信</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 降至零。</p>\n<h3>调整反向预取</h3>\n<p>FSDP 中控制重叠的主要调节项是 <code>backward_prefetch</code> 策略。此设置决定了系统何时请求下一层（在反向序列中）的参数 (parameter)。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>BACKWARD_POST：</strong> 这是默认的更安全选项。它仅在层 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span> 完成计算后才请求层 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N-1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span> 的参数。这通常会导致与上图左侧类似的序列化。</li>\n<li><strong>BACKWARD_PRE：</strong> 此策略在层 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span> 的计算开始时立即发出层 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N-1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span> 的 <code>AllGather</code>。这可以最大化重叠窗口。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>然而，<code>BACKWARD_PRE</code> 会增加峰值内存压力，因为两组分片参数（当前和下一组）必须同时在 VRAM 中实例化。如果您发现 OOM 错误，可能需要恢复到 <code>BACKWARD_POST</code> 或启用 CPU 卸载，并接受性能损失。</p>\n<h3>算术强度与通信隐藏</h3>\n<p>隐藏通信的能力严格受限于给定层计算与通信的比率。这种关系依赖于模型架构和批次大小。</p>\n<p>对于 Transformer 块，通信量与参数 (parameter)大小 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span></span> 成比例，而计算量与 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P \times B</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">im</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">es</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span> 成比例（其中 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span> 是批次大小）。随着批次大小的增加，计算时间呈线性增长，但通信时间大致保持不变（假设带宽固定）。</p>\n<p><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>计算时间</mtext><mo>∝</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>B</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>P</mi></mrow><mtext>FLOPS</mtext></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{计算时间} \\propto \\frac{B \\cdot P}{\\text{FLOPS}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">计算时间</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∝</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2173em;vertical-align:-0.345em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8723em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">FLOPS</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">⋅</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span>\n<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>通信时间</mtext><mo>∝</mo><mfrac><mi>P</mi><mtext>带宽</mtext></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{通信时间} \\propto \\frac{P}{\\text{带宽}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">通信时间</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∝</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2173em;vertical-align:-0.345em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8723em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">带宽</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p>因此，更大的批次大小使得隐藏通信变得更容易。如果您的性能分析显示存在明显的暴露通信，并且无法进一步优化网络，那么增加批次大小（或梯度累积步数）通常是最有效的软件层面修正。</p>\n<p>以下图表演示了随着本地批次大小的增加，暴露通信的比例如何减少，最终在网络完全隐藏时趋于平稳。</p>\n\n            <div\n              class=\"plotly-container\" \n              data-plot-id=\"plot-1y7nj23\" \n              data-plot-definition='{\n  \"layout\": {\n    \"title\": \"批次大小对通信隐藏的影响\",\n    \"xaxis\": { \"title\": \"本地批次大小（令牌数）\", \"showgrid\": true, \"gridcolor\": \"#dee2e6\" },\n    \"yaxis\": { \"title\": \"时间 (毫秒)\", \"showgrid\": true, \"gridcolor\": \"#dee2e6\" },\n    \"plot_bgcolor\": \"#ffffff\",\n    \"paper_bgcolor\": \"#ffffff\",\n    \"legend\": { \"orientation\": \"h\", \"y\": -0.2 }\n  },\n  \"data\": [\n    {\n      \"x\": [1024, 2048, 4096, 8192, 16384],\n      \"y\": [150, 150, 150, 150, 150],\n      \"type\": \"scatter\",\n      \"mode\": \"lines\",\n      \"name\": \"总通信时间（网络）\",\n      \"line\": { \"color\": \"#fa5252\", \"width\": 3, \"dash\": \"dot\" }\n    },\n    {\n      \"x\": [1024, 2048, 4096, 8192, 16384],\n      \"y\": [40, 80, 160, 320, 640],\n      \"type\": \"scatter\",\n      \"mode\": \"lines+markers\",\n      \"name\": \"计算时间（数学运算）\",\n      \"line\": { \"color\": \"#228be6\", \"width\": 3 }\n    },\n    {\n      \"x\": [1024, 2048, 4096, 8192, 16384],\n      \"y\": [110, 70, 0, 0, 0],\n      \"type\": \"bar\",\n      \"name\": \"暴露通信（停滞）\",\n      \"marker\": { \"color\": \"#fab005\" }\n    }\n  ]\n}' \n              style=\"max-width: 800px; margin: 0 auto; min-height: 300px;\"\n            >\n              <div id=\"plot-1y7nj23\" style=\"width: 100%; min-height: 300px;\"></div>\n            </div>\n          \n<blockquote>\n<p>随着批次大小的增加，计算时间最终会超过通信时间，从而消除了暴露通信停滞（黄色条）。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h3>同步屏障与 CPU 抖动</h3>\n<p>有时，性能分析显示存在暴露通信，即使理论计算表明可以重叠。这通常是由于 CPU 端的低效率造成的。</p>\n<p>FSDP 依赖 CPU 分派内核。如果 CPU 落后（受 CPU 限制），它无法足够快地发出 <code>AllGather</code> 指令来填充流水线。这在追踪中表现为 GPU 时间线上的内核之间出现“间隙”，通常伴随着 CPU 线程上长时间的 <code>cudaStreamSynchronize</code> 调用。</p>\n<p>为了减轻这种情况：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>确保您的 <code>DataLoader</code> 没有成为主进程的瓶颈。</li>\n<li>检查自定义 <code>nn.Module</code> 代码中是否存在过多的 Python 开销。</li>\n<li>使用 <code>torch.compile</code>（在 PyTorch 2.x 中）来合并内核并减少 Python 解释器开销，从而腾出 CPU 周期以更有效地管理 NCCL 流。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>分析重叠是一个迭代过程。您找出最大的间隙，调整预取深度或批次大小，然后重新进行性能分析，直到 GPU 计算流显示出连续、不间断的执行块。</p>",
